# Angular standards

Read [`docs/angular-standards.md`](../../docs/angular-standards.md) before editing. Short version:

- `@if` / `@for` (with `track`) / `@switch`, not `*ngIf` / `*ngFor` / `*ngSwitch`
- `input()` / `output()`, not `@Input` / `@Output`; reactive forms, not `ngModel`
- `signal()` / `computed()`; the library must work in zoneless hosts
- `inject()` + `DestroyRef` cleanup; separate `.ts` / `.html` / `.scss`; library components OnPush with `mr-` selectors
- No hardcoded status colours: `--app-color-*` from the host, `--mr-*` with `:host` defaults

Reference: `projects/mermaid-runtime/src/lib/graph-preview/`. Don't migrate untouched legacy code.
